<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>New Class Scheduled</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <h2>Class Scheduled!</h2>
    <p>A new class has been scheduled for <strong><%= studentName %></strong> with <strong><%= teacherName %></strong>.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Date:</strong> <%= date %></li>
        <li><strong>Time:</strong> <%= time %></li>
    </ul>
    <% if (link) { %>
    <p>You can join the class using the following link:</p>
    <p><a href="<%= link %>"><%= link %></a></p>
    <% } %>
    <p>Best regards,<br>The MathBuddy Team</p>
</body>
</html>
